{"id":"ecfb8f49ad1dc1fc","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-aronszajn.md","title":"Aronszajn Tree","display":"df-aronszajn — Aronszajn Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-aronszajn","aliases":["58-df-aronszajn"],"display":"df-aronszajn — Aronszajn Tree","depends_on":["[[58-df-tree-property]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-aronszajn"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-aronszajn</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-aronszajn — Aronszajn Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"58-df-tree-property\">58-df-tree-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\mathcal T,T,R,b\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\mathcal T,T,R,b\\in V\\)</span> (set-theoretic parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\)</span> (tree predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" href=\"?note=e72a83d57cf9c8fb\" title=\"58-df-tree-property\">58-df-tree-property</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa(\\mathcal T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa(\\mathcal T)\\)</span> (predicate on a coded ordered tree, defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}aronszajn} \\vdash \\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\exists T,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal T=\\langle T,R\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}aronszajn} \\vdash \\mathrm{Aronszajn}_\\kappa(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\land\\exists T,R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal T=\\langle T,R\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{KappaTree}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\land\\neg\\exists b\\;\\mathrm{CofinalBranch}_S(b,T,R,\\kappa)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>-Aronszajn trees exist in ZFC.</li>\n<li>Aronszajn trees show tree property fails at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tree-property","status":"resolved","id":"e72a83d57cf9c8fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tree-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resol